### Run `npm run watch` first. Spaces are written %20 and quotes %27.
@base = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/query

### $select: only the fields you need
GET {{base}}/Claims?$select=title,amount&$top=3

### $filter and $orderby: approved claims above 50, largest first
GET {{base}}/Claims?$filter=status%20eq%20%27A%27%20and%20amount%20gt%2050&$orderby=amount%20desc&$select=title,amount

### $top and $skip: the second page of five claims
GET {{base}}/Claims?$top=5&$skip=5&$orderby=ID&$select=title

### $count: how many claims are above 50, without the rows
GET {{base}}/Claims?$filter=amount%20gt%2050&$count=true&$top=0

### $expand: one claim with its items
GET {{base}}/Claims(4)?$expand=items($select=category,amount)&$select=title

### $batch: two reads in one request
POST {{base}}/$batch
Content-Type: application/json

< ./batch.json

### A write: create a claim with one item
POST {{base}}/Claims
Content-Type: application/json

< ./new-claim.json

### Change one field
PATCH {{base}}/Claims(13)
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "A" }
